'''''Orobanche densiflora''''' is a species of plant in the family [[Orobanchaceae]]. ''O. densiflora f. melitensis'' was reputed to be endemic to [[Malta]]<ref>{{Cite book |last=Schembri |first=Patrick |title=Red Data Book For The Maltese Islands |publisher=Department Of Information |year=1989 |pages=32}}</ref> however such information is not corroborated by recent accounts.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Orobanche densiflora Salzm. ex Reuter - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/5657270|access-date=2021-12-24|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Orobanche densiflora Salzm. ex Reut.|url=https://www.gbif.org/species/3733897|access-date=2021-12-24|website=www.gbif.org|language=en}}</ref>

